  "label": "User projected onto the textual material as the enslaved person",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material (text_chunk) which uses the first-person plural 'you' ('you pluck cotton from his field'), implying the user identifies with the enslaved person being punished by the master. The user sees themselves as the one who performed the labor (plucking cotton) and is now being denied sustenance (watermelon) by the master, who is symbolized by the aggressor boxer (boxer_1).",
